'''Lawrence Okoye'''{{Audio|LL-Q33578_(ibo)-Goodymeraj-Lawrence_Okoye.wav|Listen|help=no}} (born 6 October 1991) is a British [[track and field]] athlete and former [[American football]] [[defensive tackle]]. He is the [[British records in athletics|British record]] holder in the [[Discus throw|discus event]], and a five-time British champion in the event as of 2026. Okoye became the first ever British athlete to win a medal in Discus at a European Championships during Munich 2022. He has also played [[rugby union]].<ref>[http://iaaf.org/athletes/biographies/letter=o/athcode=257631/index.html Okoye Lawrence]. IAAF. Retrieved on 21 May 2012.</ref>
